### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Create project
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ai-dev-assistant",
  "repositoryPath": "D:\\demo\\faceAI",
  "defaultBranch": "main",
  "description": "AI 企业级研发助手平台"
}

### List projects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects

### Get project
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### Update project
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "ai-dev-assistant",
  "repositoryPath": "D:\\demo\\faceAI",
  "defaultBranch": "main",
  "description": "Step 3 项目管理"
}

### Delete project
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### List git commits
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/git/commits?limit=10

### Get git commit detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/git/commits/{commitId}

### Get git commit diff
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/git/commits/{commitId}/diff


### Create review task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/review-tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "commitId": "{commitId}"
}

### List review tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/review-tasks?projectId=1

### Get review task detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/review-tasks/1
